                    <ref target="#d207">Document 207</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d219-f3" n="3" xml:id="d219-f3-content">
                <p>The Commander of the Sixth Fleet estimated that the aircraft would be launched at
                    1345Z, or 0945 EDT, and would arrive on the scene 1 hour and 30 minutes later
                    (see <ref target="#d207">Document 207</ref>).</p>
            </note>
